<title>USA: J. Alexander's Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>J. Alexander's Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>		    (In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					  Year Ended     Quarter Ended</p>
<p>				Dec. 29, Dec. 31,   Dec. 29, Dec. 31,</p>
<p>				    1996     1995	 1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		   $90,879  $79,288    $20,239  $20,633</p>
